@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> ExerciseSelected

state ExerciseSelected {
  [*] --> LoadRuntimeConfig
  LoadRuntimeConfig : load ExerciseDefinition
  LoadRuntimeConfig : load optional CalibrationProfile
}

ExerciseSelected --> SetupChecking : open camera / pose available
SetupChecking --> SetupGuidance : required landmarks missing\nwrong orientation/view\nconfidence unstable
SetupGuidance --> SetupChecking : user repositions phone/body
SetupChecking --> Ready : setup valid for stability window

Ready --> ActiveSet : user taps Start Set
ActiveSet --> TrackingDegraded : quality gate invalid beyond debounce
TrackingDegraded --> ActiveSet : quality valid for recovery window
TrackingDegraded --> RepositionRequired : invalid persists
RepositionRequired --> ActiveSet : setup recovers and stabilizes

ActiveSet --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
TrackingDegraded --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
RepositionRequired --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
Finalizing --> Ready : analyzer/rules finalized\nSetCloseBarrier committed

ExerciseSelected --> [*] : leave workout
Ready --> [*] : leave workout

note right of SetupChecking
This is camera/setup calibration, not a claim of exact
anthropometric limb-length measurement from one phone camera.
Height may be user-provided for normalized context, but the app
must not invent exact limb lengths in centimeters.
end note

note right of Ready
Start Set is enabled only after a stable valid setup window.
Exact stability duration and confidence thresholds belong in SPEC/tests.
end note

note right of TrackingDegraded
Do not advance rep state, evaluate biomechanics form rules,
or deliver form cues while tracking quality is invalid.
Camera/setup guidance may still be shown.
Short-lived TrackingEvent records meaningful state transitions.
end note

note right of RepositionRequired
A prolonged invalid state should prefer clear reposition guidance
over repeated form coaching. Recovery is automatic once the setup
is valid again for the configured recovery window.
end note

note right of Finalizing
Stop Set first quiesces in-flight analysis, then finalizes partial
rep/rule state, then commits the reserved SetCloseBarrier.
end note

@enduml
